    "text": "Mage we gyt her gehyran, men \u00fea leofestan, eowre sawle \u00feearfe, gif ge me hlystan wylla\u00f0 & on eowre\nWe secga\u00f0 eac to so\u00fean \u00fe\u00e6t hit is yfel wise \u00fe\u00e6t monige, men \u00fea leofestan, syndon on \u00feisum life.\nSwa \u00fe\u00e6t hig syndon beswicene \u00f0urh deofles lare ealles to swi\u00f0e, \u00feurh \u00fe\u00e6t, \u00feonne \u00f0e man \u00feenc\u00f0 swi\u00f0e\nHw\u00e6t, he lyt ge\u00feenc\u00f0 on his mode \u00fe\u00e6t he nah anre tide f\u00e6ces geweald be his lifes lenge.\nEac hit is swi\u00fee uncu\u00f0 us eallum, geongum ge ealdum, hw\u00e6nne seo tid o\u00f0\u00f0e se d\u00e6g sy to cumen \u00fe\u00e6t se\nFor\u00fean ic bidde ne beswice us n\u00e6fre \u00feeos \u00fewyre orsorhnus \u00feyllic, ac \u00e6fre habbe we ures dea\u00fees d\u00e6g\nUtan ge\u00feencan \u00fe\u00e6t \u00f0is is sceort wuldor on \u00feissere worulde & tydderlice syndon \u00feas tida, & feallendlice\nBe \u00feam se halga mann Sanctus Augustinus w\u00e6s specende iu & \u00feus cw\u00e6\u00fe: O homo dic mihi ubi sunt\nHu ne syndon hi ealle gewitene & aweg afaren, swa swa axan o\u00fe\u00fee mannes swefn \u00feonne he of sl\u00e6pe\nLa hw\u00e6t, \u00fe\u00e6t gold & \u00fe\u00e6t seolfer & seo fr\u00e6tewung & eall \u00fe\u00e6t hi her on \u00feisum middangearde \u00e6fter hym\n\u00dear heora wyrmas ne swelta\u00f0 n\u00e6fre, ne heora fyr \u00fear n\u00e6fre adw\u00e6sced ne by\u00f0.\nBe \u00feam hit awriten is: Potentes cum potentibus tormenta patiuntur.; \u00fear \u00fea rican eac mid \u00feam rican\nWala \u00feam \u00fee on \u00feystrum wunigan sceal, on swa langum sea\u00f0e & on swa \u00feystrum stowum & on swa\nEala, man \u00fee \u00feis gehyrst \u00fe\u00e6t ic \u00f0e secge, \u00fe\u00e6t on \u00fe\u00e6re stowe \u00fee f\u00e6der ne gehelp\u00f0 his suna, ne him to\nNe \u00fe\u00e6r naht elles nis gehyred butan wanung & granung & grisbitung of to\u00fee.\nHw\u00e6t, \u00fear m\u00e6nig earm man sec\u00f0 georne, & him wisce\u00f0 dea\u00fees ende, & hi hw\u00e6\u00f0ere \u00fear n\u00e6fre sweltan\n\u00dear eac swilce beo\u00f0 \u00fea earman mid \u00feam earmum \u00e6fre gemengede, & \u00fea oferhydigan mid \u00feam\n\u00dear beo\u00f0 \u00fea gitseras mid \u00feam unrihtnimendum \u00feeofum, & \u00fear beo\u00f0 eac gewislice \u00fea unrihtwise\nSo\u00f0lice \u00feis halig gewrit cwy\u00f0, \u00fe\u00e6t ealle \u00feas fordonan & heora gelican on mycelre unare beo\u00f0 \u00fear\nSwa \u00f0e eadiga Augustinus \u00feur God be \u00feam s\u00e6de \u00fee \u00feis godspel dihte & \u00feus cw\u00e6\u00f0, Dominicae\nNabba\u00f0 \u00fea sawla witodlice nane o\u00f0re reste \u00fee on witum beo\u00f0 butan on \u00feam drihtenlican \u00e6riste.\nOn \u00feam d\u00e6ge \u00fee drihten of dea\u00fee aras, \u00feonne mot anra gehwylces mannes sawl, ge so\u00f0f\u00e6stes mannes\nUton nu \u00fei gehyran hw\u00e6t \u00f0e gode gast spec\u00f0 to \u00feam lichaman \u00feonne he him \u00e6rest to cym\u00f0.\n\u00deonne gret he hine \u00feus \u00feysum wordum, Bene ualeas bene sis qui bonum uas electio mihi fuisti, amice\nEall swa ic wolde \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feu w\u00e6re godes donde.\nEall \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feu me ge\u00feafodest, & \u00feu a Godes engla larum geornor hyrsumedest, \u00feonne \u00feu \u00e6fre deofles\nSo\u00f0lice \u00feonne ic wolde \u00fe\u00e6t \u00f0u f\u00e6stest o\u00f0\u00f0e \u00e6lmessan sealdest for Godes lufan, o\u00f0\u00f0e \u00e6nig god w\u00e6re\nEall \u00feu \u00fe\u00e6t dudest, earme \u00feu gefrefrodest, nacode \u00feu scruddest, untrume \u00feu geneosedest, \u00feearfan \u00feu\nGodes \u00feam halgum gewritum \u00feu georne gehyrdest, & \u00feare lare hlystest \u00fee hig gode folce bodedon &\nEalles \u00feyses \u00feu w\u00e6re me ge\u00feafiend, & mid eallum \u00feisum gegyredest \u00fe\u00e6t ic on godre reste \u00fein beo\nGereste nu on sibbe, & ic eft hwyrfe to \u00fee, & ic \u00feonne mot beon mid \u00fee \u00e6fre si\u00f0\u00f0en, & \u00feu \u00feonne\n\u00de\u00e6s wuldres bruca\u00f0 \u00e6fre \u00fea \u00fee Godes willan wyrca\u00f0 on \u00feisum life, & hi \u00fe\u00e6r beo\u00f0 scinende &\nUngelice cwyde \u00feonne \u00feysum by\u00f0 \u00fees synfullan mannes sawl sprecende to \u00feam synfullan lichaman\nWa \u00fee, for\u00fean \u00fee \u00feu worhtest mycel yfel mid me \u00fea \u00feu on life w\u00e6re & on eor\u00fean, & ic unl\u00e6de w\u00e6s\n\u00deu noldest n\u00e6fre beon gehyrsum Godes engla larum wi\u00f0 deofles costnungum.\nHe \u00fee l\u00e6rde \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feu manigfealde synne w\u00e6re begangende & \u00feu him \u00fe\u00e6s ge\u00feafa w\u00e6re, & \u00e6t \u00e6restan\nLige nu on \u00feysum duste aful\u00e6d & forrotad, & ic eom gecwylmed & forb\u00e6rned d\u00e6ghwamlice on\nFor\u00fean domes d\u00e6g is wel neah \u00fee \u00feu arisan scealt, & ic \u00feonne cume to \u00fee, & \u00feu \u00feonne onfehst min\n& wyt \u00feonne beo\u00f0 mid deofle, & wyt \u00fear beo\u00f0 gecwylmede & getintregode butan \u00e6lcum ende \u00e6fre to\nLa \u00feu, man \u00fee \u00feis nu gehyrest, forhta nu ic bidde, & ondr\u00e6d for \u00feinum synnum & for \u00feinum\nFor\u00fean, men \u00fea leofestan, se mildheorta cyning us swi\u00fee lufelice clypa\u00f0 to so\u00f0re d\u00e6dbote ura synna to\nFor\u00fean he cw\u00e6\u00f0, Nelle ic \u00fe\u00e6s synfullan mannes dea\u00f0, ac ic wylle \u00fe\u00e6t he gecyrre \u00e6r his ende, & he\n& eft se witega us manede \u00feus cwe\u00feende, Nelle ge efestan & ondr\u00e6dan eow.\nGif ge wylla\u00f0 gehwyrfan on tid to drihtene mid d\u00e6dbote, ne ylce ge nanig fram d\u00e6ge to d\u00e6ge.\nFor\u00fean \u00fee \u00f0e by\u00f0 gehwyrfed mid geomerunge \u00fee by\u00f0 ece hal.\nUton we nu eac georne gecyrran to drihtene on Godes \u00feeowdome, & utan secan hine nu we hine ea\u00f0e\nFeor he by\u00f0 on domesd\u00e6ge \u00e6lcum \u00fe\u00e6re \u00fee hine nu secan nele mid synna d\u00e6dbote.\nSece we hine nu, nu we gehyra\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t we hine gemetan magon, & behreowsigan we nu & wepan ure\nNu bidde ic eow, \u00fea hwile \u00fee ge on \u00feysan middangearde beon mote, & \u00fe\u00e6t ge cyrre to d\u00e6dbote &\n& bidde we God \u00fe\u00e6t we magon geearnigan forgifennyssa ealra ura misd\u00e6da, \u00fe\u00e6t we magon forbugan\nFor\u00feon, men \u00fea leofestan, nu \u00fea hwile \u00fee we on \u00feissere worulde beo\u00f0, uton beon wel donde &\n\u00dee, Drihten, se \u00f0e leofa\u00f0 & rixa\u00f0 mid \u00feam F\u00e6der & mid \u00feam Sune & mid \u00feam Halgan Gaste a to",
